{"5208": {"main": "<p><img src=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/assets/ilearn/banner-1-role.jpg\" alt=\"The role of operations management\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\"></p><div style=\"background-color:#003146;color:#ffffff;font-family:Georgia, serif;padding:18px;\"><strong>Syllabus - students learn about</strong></div><ul><li>Strategic role of operations management - cost leadership, good/service differentiation</li><li>Goods and/or services in different industries</li><li>Interdependence with other key business functions</li></ul><div style=\"background-color:#f7eee9;color:#003146;padding:14px;\"><strong>In this folder:</strong> Lessons 1-4 and the Re-teach A and B lessons: slides, note guides, worksheets and the Jacaranda Chapter 2 summary.</div><p>&nbsp;</p><div style=\"background-color:#ffc20e;color:#003146;padding:14px;\"><strong>Study tip:</strong> Learn the two strategic roles (cost leadership and differentiation) with one real business example for each.</div>", "side": "<p><a href=\"https://ilearn.gosford.spcc.nsw.edu.au/homepage/5207\"><img src=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/assets/ilearn/ops-banner.jpg\" alt=\"Back to Operations Master Files\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\"></a></p><div style=\"background-color:#003146;color:#ffffff;padding:14px;\"><strong>Back to Master Files</strong> - click the banner above.</div><p>&nbsp;</p><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; table-layout: fixed;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 50%; padding: 4px; border: none;\"><a href=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/operations.html#terms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/assets/tiles/flashcards.jpg\" alt=\"Online flashcards\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\"></a></td><td style=\"width: 50%; padding: 4px; border: none;\"><a href=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/operations.html#dotpoints\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/assets/tiles/dot-point-finder.jpg\" alt=\"Dot Point Finder\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\"></a></td></tr></tbody></table>"}, "5209": {"main": "<p><img src=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/assets/ilearn/banner-2-influences.jpg\" alt=\"Influences on operations\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\"></p><div style=\"background-color:#003146;color:#ffffff;font-family:Georgia, serif;padding:18px;\"><strong>Syllabus - students learn about</strong></div><ul><li>Globalisation, technology, quality expectations, cost-based competition, government policies, legal regulation, environmental sustainability</li><li>Corporate social responsibility - the difference between legal compliance and ethical responsibility</li><li>Environmental sustainability and social responsibility</li></ul><div style=\"background-color:#f7eee9;color:#003146;padding:14px;\"><strong>In this folder:</strong> Lessons 5-9: slides, worksheets (standard and supported), sort cards and the dot point recall test.</div><p>&nbsp;</p><div style=\"background-color:#ffc20e;color:#003146;padding:14px;\"><strong>Study tip:</strong> For every influence, be ready to explain how it changes what an operations manager actually does.</div>", "side": "<p><a href=\"https://ilearn.gosford.spcc.nsw.edu.au/homepage/5207\"><img src=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/assets/ilearn/ops-banner.jpg\" alt=\"Back to Operations Master Files\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\"></a></p><div style=\"background-color:#003146;color:#ffffff;padding:14px;\"><strong>Back to Master Files</strong> - click the banner above.</div><p>&nbsp;</p><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; table-layout: fixed;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 50%; padding: 4px; border: none;\"><a href=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/operations.html#terms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/assets/tiles/flashcards.jpg\" alt=\"Online flashcards\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\"></a></td><td style=\"width: 50%; padding: 4px; border: none;\"><a href=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/operations.html#dotpoints\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/assets/tiles/dot-point-finder.jpg\" alt=\"Dot Point Finder\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\"></a></td></tr></tbody></table>"}, "5210": {"main": "<p><img src=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/assets/ilearn/banner-3-processes.jpg\" alt=\"Operations processes\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\"></p><div style=\"background-color:#003146;color:#ffffff;font-family:Georgia, serif;padding:18px;\"><strong>Syllabus - students learn about</strong></div><ul><li>Inputs - transformed resources (materials, information, customers) and transforming resources (human resources, facilities)</li><li>Transformation processes - volume, variety, variation in demand and visibility; sequencing and scheduling (Gantt charts, critical path analysis); technology, task design and process layout; monitoring, control and improvement</li><li>Outputs - customer service, warranties</li></ul><div style=\"background-color:#f7eee9;color:#003146;padding:14px;\"><strong>In this folder:</strong> Lessons 10-13: slides, worksheets, card sorts, the Task 1 planner and the Sequencing and Scheduling Skills Booklet.</div><p>&nbsp;</p><div style=\"background-color:#ffc20e;color:#003146;padding:14px;\"><strong>Study tip:</strong> Practise drawing a Gantt chart and finding the critical path until you can do it without notes.</div>", "side": "<p><a href=\"https://ilearn.gosford.spcc.nsw.edu.au/homepage/5207\"><img src=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/assets/ilearn/ops-banner.jpg\" alt=\"Back to Operations Master Files\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\"></a></p><div style=\"background-color:#003146;color:#ffffff;padding:14px;\"><strong>Back to Master Files</strong> - click the banner above.</div><p>&nbsp;</p><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; table-layout: fixed;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 50%; padding: 4px; border: none;\"><a href=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/operations.html#terms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/assets/tiles/flashcards.jpg\" alt=\"Online flashcards\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\"></a></td><td style=\"width: 50%; padding: 4px; border: none;\"><a href=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/operations.html#dotpoints\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/assets/tiles/dot-point-finder.jpg\" alt=\"Dot Point Finder\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\"></a></td></tr></tbody></table>"}, "5211": {"main": "<p><img src=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/assets/ilearn/banner-4-strategies.jpg\" alt=\"Operations strategies\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\"></p><div style=\"background-color:#003146;color:#ffffff;font-family:Georgia, serif;padding:18px;\"><strong>Syllabus - students learn about</strong></div><ul><li>Performance objectives - quality, speed, dependability, flexibility, customisation, cost</li><li>New product or service design and development</li><li>Supply chain management - logistics, e-commerce, global sourcing</li><li>Outsourcing - advantages and disadvantages</li><li>Technology - leading edge, established</li><li>Inventory management - holding stock, LIFO, FIFO, JIT</li><li>Quality management - control, assurance, improvement</li><li>Overcoming resistance to change - financial costs, purchasing new equipment, redundancy payments, retraining, reorganising plant layout, inertia</li><li>Global factors - global sourcing, economies of scale, scanning and learning, research and development</li></ul><div style=\"background-color:#f7eee9;color:#003146;padding:14px;\"><strong>In this folder:</strong> Strategies lessons are added here as they are taught. The Peter Blake quick test is here now.</div><p>&nbsp;</p><div style=\"background-color:#ffc20e;color:#003146;padding:14px;\"><strong>Study tip:</strong> Strategies are where the marks are. Link every strategy to a performance objective and a real business.</div>", "side": "<p><a href=\"https://ilearn.gosford.spcc.nsw.edu.au/homepage/5207\"><img src=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/assets/ilearn/ops-banner.jpg\" alt=\"Back to Operations Master Files\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\"></a></p><div style=\"background-color:#003146;color:#ffffff;padding:14px;\"><strong>Back to Master Files</strong> - click the banner above.</div><p>&nbsp;</p><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; table-layout: fixed;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 50%; padding: 4px; border: none;\"><a href=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/operations.html#terms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/assets/tiles/flashcards.jpg\" alt=\"Online flashcards\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\"></a></td><td style=\"width: 50%; padding: 4px; border: none;\"><a href=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/operations.html#dotpoints\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/assets/tiles/dot-point-finder.jpg\" alt=\"Dot Point Finder\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\"></a></td></tr></tbody></table>"}, "5212": {"main": "<p><img src=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/assets/ilearn/banner-start-here.jpg\" alt=\"Start here\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\"></p><div style=\"background-color:#003146;color:#ffffff;font-family:Georgia, serif;padding:18px;\"><strong>What to do</strong></div><ul><li>Read the Syllabus Skeleton so you know every dot point</li><li>Set up your folder with the HSC Launch divider covers</li><li>Keep the student handout at the front of your folder</li></ul><div style=\"background-color:#f7eee9;color:#003146;padding:14px;\"><strong>In this folder:</strong> The Operations syllabus skeleton, HSC Launch handout, folder divider covers and laminated cards.</div><p>&nbsp;</p><div style=\"background-color:#ffc20e;color:#003146;padding:14px;\"><strong>Study tip:</strong> Tick off each dot point on the Syllabus Skeleton as we finish it.</div>", "side": "<p><a href=\"https://ilearn.gosford.spcc.nsw.edu.au/homepage/5207\"><img src=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/assets/ilearn/ops-banner.jpg\" alt=\"Back to Operations Master Files\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\"></a></p><div style=\"background-color:#003146;color:#ffffff;padding:14px;\"><strong>Back to Master Files</strong> - click the banner above.</div><p>&nbsp;</p><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; table-layout: fixed;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 50%; padding: 4px; border: none;\"><a href=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/operations.html#terms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/assets/tiles/flashcards.jpg\" alt=\"Online flashcards\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\"></a></td><td style=\"width: 50%; padding: 4px; border: none;\"><a href=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/operations.html#dotpoints\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/assets/tiles/dot-point-finder.jpg\" alt=\"Dot Point Finder\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\"></a></td></tr></tbody></table>"}, "5213": {"main": "<p><img src=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/assets/ilearn/banner-flashcards.jpg\" alt=\"Flashcards\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\"></p><div style=\"background-color:#003146;color:#ffffff;font-family:Georgia, serif;padding:18px;\"><strong>What to do</strong></div><ul><li>All 22 sets in one PDF, or print just the set you need</li><li>The same cards are on the Year 12 website as flip cards you can shuffle</li><li>Test yourself a little every day rather than a lot the night before</li></ul><div style=\"background-color:#f7eee9;color:#003146;padding:14px;\"><strong>In this folder:</strong> Flashcards All Sets plus Sets 01 to 22 (Student Copy PDFs).</div><p>&nbsp;</p><div style=\"background-color:#ffc20e;color:#003146;padding:14px;\"><strong>Study tip:</strong> Say the answer out loud before you flip. If you get it wrong, put it back in the pile.</div>", "side": "<p><a href=\"https://ilearn.gosford.spcc.nsw.edu.au/homepage/5207\"><img src=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/assets/ilearn/ops-banner.jpg\" alt=\"Back to Operations Master Files\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\"></a></p><div style=\"background-color:#003146;color:#ffffff;padding:14px;\"><strong>Back to Master Files</strong> - click the banner above.</div><p>&nbsp;</p><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; table-layout: fixed;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 50%; padding: 4px; border: none;\"><a href=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/operations.html#terms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/assets/tiles/flashcards.jpg\" alt=\"Online flashcards\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\"></a></td><td style=\"width: 50%; padding: 4px; border: none;\"><a href=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/operations.html#dotpoints\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/assets/tiles/dot-point-finder.jpg\" alt=\"Dot Point Finder\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\"></a></td></tr></tbody></table>"}, "5214": {"main": "<p><img src=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/assets/ilearn/banner-practice-questions.jpg\" alt=\"Practice questions\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\"></p><div style=\"background-color:#003146;color:#ffffff;font-family:Georgia, serif;padding:18px;\"><strong>What to do</strong></div><ul><li>Excel HSC Copilot - Know the Dot Points workbook</li><li>Syllabus dot point recall test</li><li>Past HSC questions are added as we reach them</li></ul><div style=\"background-color:#f7eee9;color:#003146;padding:14px;\"><strong>In this folder:</strong> Practice workbooks and recall tests for Operations.</div><p>&nbsp;</p><div style=\"background-color:#ffc20e;color:#003146;padding:14px;\"><strong>Study tip:</strong> Always check the verb first. Explain, discuss and assess ask for different things.</div>", "side": "<p><a href=\"https://ilearn.gosford.spcc.nsw.edu.au/homepage/5207\"><img src=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/assets/ilearn/ops-banner.jpg\" alt=\"Back to Operations Master Files\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\"></a></p><div style=\"background-color:#003146;color:#ffffff;padding:14px;\"><strong>Back to Master Files</strong> - click the banner above.</div><p>&nbsp;</p><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; table-layout: fixed;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 50%; padding: 4px; border: none;\"><a href=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/operations.html#terms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/assets/tiles/flashcards.jpg\" alt=\"Online flashcards\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\"></a></td><td style=\"width: 50%; padding: 4px; border: none;\"><a href=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/operations.html#dotpoints\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/assets/tiles/dot-point-finder.jpg\" alt=\"Dot Point Finder\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\"></a></td></tr></tbody></table>"}, "5215": {"main": "<p><img src=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/assets/ilearn/banner-case-studies.jpg\" alt=\"Case studies\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\"></p><div style=\"background-color:#003146;color:#ffffff;font-family:Georgia, serif;padding:18px;\"><strong>What to do</strong></div><ul><li>Cochlear (Cambridge 5E Ch18-19)</li><li>Kathmandu (Jacaranda 7E)</li><li>ALDI - cost leadership</li><li>Qantas articles</li><li>Enspire Furniture and Mariners Rest Hotel (Excel HSC)</li><li>CSR and lean production readings (Patagonia, Walmart)</li></ul><div style=\"background-color:#f7eee9;color:#003146;padding:14px;\"><strong>In this folder:</strong> Real businesses to use as examples in your answers.</div><p>&nbsp;</p><div style=\"background-color:#ffc20e;color:#003146;padding:14px;\"><strong>Study tip:</strong> Pick two businesses and know them well: what they make, how they compete and one operations strategy each uses.</div>", "side": "<p><a href=\"https://ilearn.gosford.spcc.nsw.edu.au/homepage/5207\"><img src=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/assets/ilearn/ops-banner.jpg\" alt=\"Back to Operations Master Files\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\"></a></p><div style=\"background-color:#003146;color:#ffffff;padding:14px;\"><strong>Back to Master Files</strong> - click the banner above.</div><p>&nbsp;</p><table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; table-layout: fixed;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 50%; padding: 4px; border: none;\"><a href=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/operations.html#terms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/assets/tiles/flashcards.jpg\" alt=\"Online flashcards\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\"></a></td><td style=\"width: 50%; padding: 4px; border: none;\"><a href=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/operations.html#dotpoints\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://mrsperkinsteacher.github.io/business/year12/assets/tiles/dot-point-finder.jpg\" alt=\"Dot Point Finder\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\"></a></td></tr></tbody></table>"}}